{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天水圍有校巴與的士相撞，8名學童受輕傷送院。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">校巴司機在交通意外後，駕駛另一輛校巴將學童送回學校，再向警員交代事發經過。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.TSW-1130.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026980uwXD3v11790137656.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.TSW-1130.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現場消息指，涉事校巴早上約7時半接載天水圍官立小學的學生上學，在天瑞路與一輛的士相撞。司機未有即時報警，安排學童轉乘另一輛校巴回校。校方得悉事故後檢查車上學童情況，其中有8名學童有輕微受傷，召喚救護車將他們送院治理。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.TSW-1130_004.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026A5fUS8Vg1L1790137503.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.TSW-1130_004.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T06:39:06.767292+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}